Project and design by
.An Stephane D'Alu ,
implementation with
.An Claude ,
Anthropic's coding assistant.
.Sh CAVEATS
The query cache is keyed on the text of the
.Pa make.conf
files themselves
.Pq the poudriere.d layers, synth's profile file, or a local build's Pa /etc/make.conf ,
not on the files they pull in with
.Ic .include
or
.Ic .sinclude .
After editing such an included file,
.Nm
keeps serving the answers cached under the old content, without any
warning, until the ports tree revision or a
.Pa make.conf
itself changes.
Run once with
.Fl -clear-cache
.Pq or use Fl -no-cache
to have the edit seen.
